{
  "name": "SEO 99 · Manejo de errores",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SEO 99 · Manejo de errores\n\nWorkflow de error compartido. Para activarlo:\n\n1. Abre cada workflow SEO.\n2. Menu `...` → **Settings** → **Error Workflow**.\n3. Selecciona `SEO 99 · Manejo de errores`.\n\nCada vez que una ejecucion falle recibiras el aviso en Slack con\nel nodo exacto que rompio y el enlace a la ejecucion.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b59aee16-b69a-4fa9-839a-eaf0b49aec83",
      "name": "Nota 99",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "bb7bf689-ba7b-44f6-897b-f363b87bf1d0",
      "name": "Al fallar un workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "slack",
              "name": "slackCanal",
              "value": "seo-alertas",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bdc047e1-bcc0-464e-8bc0-44bbbac04328",
      "name": "Configuracion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const evento = $input.first().json;\n\nconst wf = evento.workflow || {};\nconst ej = evento.execution || {};\nconst error = ej.error || {};\n\nconst nodoFallido = ej.lastNodeExecuted || error.node?.name || 'desconocido';\nconst detalle = (error.message || 'Sin mensaje de error').slice(0, 900);\n\nconst mensaje = [\n  '🚨 *Fallo en un workflow de SEO*',\n  '',\n  '• Workflow: *' + (wf.name || 'sin nombre') + '*',\n  '• Nodo: ' + nodoFallido,\n  '• Modo: ' + (ej.mode || 'desconocido'),\n  '• Momento: ' + new Date().toISOString(),\n  ej.url ? '• Ejecucion: ' + ej.url : '',\n  '',\n  '*Detalle*',\n  '\\`\\`\\`' + detalle + '\\`\\`\\`',\n]\n  .filter(Boolean)\n  .join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    mensaje,\n    workflowNombre: wf.name || '',\n    workflowId: wf.id || '',\n    nodo: nodoFallido,\n    error: detalle,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "12b4f413-11b4-4280-84b4-f73913b4f5a6",
      "name": "Formatear error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Configuracion').first().json.slackCanal }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.mensaje }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "839532df-8295-414c-8595-360584953472",
      "name": "Slack · Alerta de error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
